ing no recover, as in the earlier crash review. The claim is kept separate from C2, which concerns the layout of the record the recorder writes; here the complaint is which instance's record is recorded at all.\\n\\nFrontier. Nine claims are settled this cycle (seven confirmed violations or consequences, two bounded no-violation protections), the two paused candidates keep their resume conditions, and the only visible administrative item remains the scope issue on the superseded C1 artifact. No requirement, premise or earlier observation was weakened.\"}"}}
